          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The origin of ભાભી (bhābhī) is not settled. CDIAL lists the older Gujarati bhojāī, \"brother's wife\", under Sanskrit bhrāturjāyā (CDIAL 9660), but not bhābhī."
